fix: It was possible to walk in Five Stand competitions\n-Bug fix: Aborting competition did not reset the round count for regular games\n", "created_date": 1778760986, "id": "26844935768501260", "version": "2.4.1", "version_code": 767, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4341884889233002", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26848143184847185"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "432778921405375"}]}, "change_log": "Bug fix: It was possible to retry trap Clay Hunt VR+ daily competition events", "created_date": 1778567570, "id": "26815766598084844", "version": "2.4.0", "version_code": 766, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4341884889233002", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26848143184847185"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "432778921405375"}]}, "change_log": "Clay Hunt VR+ is now available in Early Access!\n\nWe\u2019ve been working on this for a long time, and we\u2019re excited to finally launch Clay Hunt VR+, a subscription service designed for dedicated players with new cloud-powered features.\n\nThe Early Access version includes:\n\u2022 Community and official Sporting Clays & Five Stand courses\n\u2022 Daily competitions with global rankings\n\u2022 Three new events every day across multiple disciplines\n\nCompete in your favorite disciplines or across all of them:\nSporting Clays, Five Stand, American & International Skeet, American & International Trap, and Double Trap.\n\nTwo major additions are already planned for the full release later this year and will be included as free updates for existing members:\n\u2022 Shooting Diary with analytics\n\u2022 Virtual Clubs with custom competitions\n\nPlease note that Clay Hunt VR+ does not include access to existing add-ons.\n\nYou can start with a 7-day free trial and continue with an annual subscription:\n\u2022 Introductory price: $39/year\n\u2022 Regular price after the first year: $49/year\n(Local pricing may vary.)\n\nTo join, open the Clay Hunt VR+ menu in the clubhouse (button next to Options). Since the service is still in Early Access, it is not yet visible in the Horizon Store app.\n\nCommunity courses can be found in Creative Mode. You can also publish your own creations for others to play! Before a course can be published, every pair must be successfully verified through gameplay testing after each update.\n\nDaily competitions and rankings are available through the Clay Hunt VR+ menu in the clubhouse. Each event stays open for 24 hours, allowing you to participate whenever it suits you. Final rankings are calculated after the event ends, and players earn ranking points based on their performance relative to others. The top shooter receives 10 points, second place receives 9 points, and so on. The ranking system is currently based on accumulated points and may still evolve before the final release.\n\nAlongside this update, we\u2019ve also updated the Privacy Policy to comply with current legislation and added Terms of Use that must be accepted to use the service.", "created_date": 1778398790, "id": "26792386757089495", "version": "2.4.0", "version_code": 765, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}